    "directions": [
      "In a non-stick kadai or wok, add oil, once it's hot, add black peppercorns, cloves, green cardamom, mace and let it splutter well.",
      "Add onions, dry kashmiri red chili and saute it for a while until translucent.",
      "Add ginger garlic paste and cook it for a minute.",
      "Add degi red chili powder, coriander powder, turmeric powder, curd and cook it for a while.",
      "Add salt to taste, fresh tomato puree and cook it for 10-12 minutes on medium flames.",
      "Add ghee, sauteed chicken and give it a good mix.",
      "Add water to adjust the consistency, tender coriander stems and simmer it for 3-4 minutes until thickens.",
      "Finish it with salt to taste, sugar, sauteed vegetables and cook it for 2-3 minutes.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish and garnish it with coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with roti or naan.",
      "In a bowl, add chicken, salt to taste, ginger garlic paste, degi red chili powder, coriander powder, dry fenugreek leaves, oil, mustard oil and give it a good mix.",
      "Keep it aside to marinate for 10-12 minutes.",
      "In a pan, add oil, once it's hot, add marinated chicken and cook for 2-3 minutes on both sides until half cooked.",
      "Transfer it to a bowl and keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a pan, add oil, once it's hot, add onion, tomato, capsicum, salt to taste and toss it on high flames for 2-3 minutes.",
      "Transfer it to a tray or bowl and keep it aside for further use."
    ],
